98
00:06:45,722 --> 00:06:47,056
¿Qué?

99
00:06:47,057 --> 00:06:48,557
Oh, Dios.

100
00:06:48,558 --> 00:06:51,244
Este viaje se volvió
muy malo, amigo.

101
00:06:54,481 --> 00:06:55,522
Yo creo que...

102
00:06:55,523 --> 00:06:57,584
