Siento que penetras mi alma.

112
00:07:47,701 --> 00:07:49,302
Déjate llevar.

113
00:07:50,412 --> 00:07:52,472
Monta el arcoíris.

114
00:08:04,426 --> 00:08:07,487
Sí. Sí. Sí.

115
00:08:19,315 --> 00:08:20,733
¿Qué carajos?

116
00:08:25,572 --> 00:08:26,697
¡Oh, Dios!

117
00:08:26,698 --> 00:08:27,799
¡Oh!

118
00:08:28,992 --> 00:08:30,034
No.

119
00:08:35,123 --> 00:08:36,474
Shh.

120
00:08:37,075 --> 00:08:39,894
Los espíritus del fuego
